5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our growth remains sustainable and our reporting remains transparent, I would like to examine the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that transparency is key. To understand the actual health of our portfolio, I want to look into account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must be mindful of our long-term liquidity. I will look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to get started! I want to see who we can actually get on board, so I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings. I believe it is important to understand the actual timeline from investment to operation.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a comprehensive spread of interests. @Mio, your enthusiasm is infectious. I believe that by looking at these different angles, we will find a path that brings both prosperity and peace of mind to the fund.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, I appreciate the sentiment, but let's stay focused on the data. I believe the actual customer behavior and the reality of our past exits will provide the most objective baseline for our next decision.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, I agree that objective data is essential. However, the baseline is only useful if we have the financial capacity to support the growth that data suggests. We must ensure our capital structure is stable.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Minako, that makes sense! But don't forget that money is only half the battle. We need the right people to actually make things happen, right? I can't wait to see what the recruiters say!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"People and capital are indeed important, but they are useless if the product never reaches the customer. I want to see where the bottlenecks actually occur before we commit.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often lies in the balance between the tangible and the intangible. While we seek data and efficiency, let us not forget that the integrity of our process is what allows us to sleep soundly at night.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, integrity is a result of accuracy, not a feeling. If our internal narratives don't match the actual retention and exit data, we aren't being honest with ourselves or our investors. That is the only way to sleep soundly.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, accuracy is indeed the foundation. However, honesty also requires acknowledging our current burn rate and liquidity. If we ignore the financial constraints of our follow-on obligations, we risk failing the very companies we invest in.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Minako, you're so serious! But that's why I'm here to keep things upbeat! If we have a great team and a strong network, I bet we can solve those financial puzzles together!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Optimism is a useful tool, @Mio, but it cannot bypass systemic delays. I am less interested in how we solve puzzles and more interested in why the puzzles exist in the first place.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,It is heartening to see such passionate debate. Let us now move forward with our investigations. May the truths we uncover guide us toward a choice that serves both our fund and the world.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I look forward to the results. Let's ensure we analyze the findings without bias, focusing on the hard evidence rather than the stories we've told ourselves.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us proceed with the investigations and return with the facts. I will be analyzing our financial flexibility carefully to ensure we can sustain this investment.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Mio,,I'm ready! I'll dive into the people side of things and see who's actually available to help us grow. Let's find a winner!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the data and identify the patterns of delay. I look forward to seeing if the evidence supports the plans or reveals a different reality.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
